---
interface Props {
  lang: "en" | "ru";
}

const { lang = "en" } = Astro.props;

const dict = {
  en: {
    svgTitle:
      "Arrays index by number, so Names indexed by number is string and as const roles indexed by number is the literal union; keyof a string index signature is string or number, not string",
    headline: "ARRAYS INDEX BY NUMBER",
    sub: "Arr[number] is the element type; a string index admits number keys",
    leftTitle: "T[number]",
    leftLine1: "Names[number] = string",
    leftLine2: "Pair[0] = string",
    leftVerdict: "Pair[number] = string | number",
    rightTitle: "keyof Dict",
    rightLine1: "{ [key: string]: number }",
    rightLine2: "dict[0] is legal",
    rightVerdict: "keyof = string | number",
    foot1: 'typeof roles[number] = "admin" | "editor" | "viewer"',
    foot2: "need finite keys? concrete props or Record<Union, V>",
    caption:
      "Arrays and tuples index by number, so Names[number] is the element type and, with as const, typeof roles[number] is the literal union from the runtime array; but keyof a string-indexed Dict is string | number because numeric keys coerce to strings — use explicit properties or Record with a union for finite keys.",
  },
  ru: {
    svgTitle:
      "Массивы индексируются number: Names по number — это string, а roles с as const по number — литеральное объединение; keyof строковой индексной сигнатуры — string или number, а не string",
    headline: "МАССИВЫ ИНДЕКСИРУЮТСЯ ЧИСЛОМ",
    sub: "Arr[number] — тип элемента; строковый индекс допускает числовые ключи",
    leftTitle: "T[number]",
    leftLine1: "Names[number] = string",
    leftLine2: "Pair[0] = string",
    leftVerdict: "Pair[number] = string | number",
    rightTitle: "keyof Dict",
    rightLine1: "{ [key: string]: number }",
    rightLine2: "dict[0] легален",
    rightVerdict: "keyof = string | number",
    foot1: 'typeof roles[number] = "admin" | "editor" | "viewer"',
    foot2: "нужны конечные ключи? явные свойства или Record<Union, V>",
    caption:
      "Массивы и кортежи индексируются number: Names[number] — тип элемента, а с as const typeof roles[number] — литеральное объединение из рантайм-массива; но keyof Dict со строковым индексом — string | number, ведь числовые ключи приводятся к строкам, — для конечных ключей бери явные свойства или Record с объединением.",
  },
};

const t = dict[lang];
---

<figure data-lesson-visual class="my-6">
  <svg id="TsEverydayIndexAccess-3" viewBox="0 0 800 420" role="img" font-family="var(--font-mono)">
    <title lang="en">{dict.en.svgTitle}</title>
    <title lang="ru">{dict.ru.svgTitle}</title>
    <text x="400" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="22" fill="var(--ink)">{t.headline}</text>
    <text x="400" y="58" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">{t.sub}</text>

    <rect x="40" y="90" width="340" height="200" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" />
    <text x="210" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--ink)">{t.leftTitle}</text>
    <text x="210" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.leftLine1}</text>
    <text x="210" y="184" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.leftLine2}</text>
    <text x="210" y="248" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.leftVerdict}</text>

    <rect x="420" y="90" width="340" height="200" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5" />
    <text x="590" y="120" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--ink)">{t.rightTitle}</text>
    <text x="590" y="158" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.rightLine1}</text>
    <text x="590" y="184" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.rightLine2}</text>
    <text x="590" y="248" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--ink)">{t.rightVerdict}</text>

    <text x="400" y="330" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.foot1}</text>
    <text x="400" y="356" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.foot2}</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption style="text-align: center;">{t.caption}</figcaption>
</figure>
